1
00:00:23,776 --> 00:00:28,515
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:32,227
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,451 --> 00:00:34,696
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,043 --> 00:00:37,750
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,629 --> 00:00:43,157
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,157 --> 00:00:46,789
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:50,755
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,899 --> 00:00:55,395
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,395 --> 00:01:00,035
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,423 --> 00:01:02,083
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:08,035
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,227 --> 00:01:11,915
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,915 --> 00:01:15,486
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,651 --> 00:01:22,595
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,043 --> 00:01:26,664
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,664 --> 00:01:30,348
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,435 --> 00:01:35,363
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,363 --> 00:01:39,523
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,267 --> 00:01:46,819
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,363 --> 00:01:50,019
=Episode 17=

21
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:55,959
Seal all their shops!

22
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,799
Xiaosheng Society?

23
00:01:58,599 --> 00:02:00,760
I'll make him a like a headless bird.

24
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:15,840
You shouldn't have come to me now.

25
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:19,080
Things have come to this,
and you can still sit tight?

26
00:02:19,439 --> 00:02:20,840
This is your brilliant plan?

27
00:02:21,719 --> 00:02:23,191
The case back then has been exposed.

28
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:25,360
Jiang Chun'er is now
the new chamber head.

29
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:28,080
The Xiaosheng Society
is under public attack.

30
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,800
And the Buddha Head and phoenix crown
are still missing.

31
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:33,159
The only thing we can do now is to wait.

32
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:35,680
Wait? Wait until Fengcheng
spirals completely out of control?

33
00:02:37,439 --> 00:02:38,639
I'm telling you,

34
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,680
if you can't come up with a useful plan,

35
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,879
the Japanese will be the first
to come after you.

36
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:45,879
We are not at a dead end yet.

37
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:47,319
Don't rush to assign blame.

38
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:54,879
By "wait", I mean my private army
will soon return to Fengcheng.

39
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:57,159
Then I'll have the power

40
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,159
to regain my military authority
as the Governor.

41
00:03:02,719 --> 00:03:03,919
Why should I still trust you?

42
00:03:03,919 --> 00:03:05,159
Do you have any other options?

43
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,039
Don't forget

44
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:11,400
that you and I

45
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:14,120
have long been in the same boat.

46
00:03:14,719 --> 00:03:16,599
Only if you help me
regain military power

47
00:03:17,919 --> 00:03:20,639
will I help you protect
the Xiaosheng Society

48
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:23,599
and find the phoenix crown
and Buddha Head.

49
00:03:33,759 --> 00:03:36,560
Tomorrow my private army
will return to Fengcheng.

50
00:03:37,159 --> 00:03:40,639
To make it work,
it still needs your cooperation.

51
00:03:41,439 --> 00:03:43,120
Start with this Rong Xiaonan.

52
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:47,080
The phoenix crown
is definitely connected to him.

53
00:03:47,719 --> 00:03:51,680
And only he knows the whereabouts
of the Buddha Head.

54
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,199
As for what comes next,

55
00:03:55,879 --> 00:03:57,639
you should know what to do.

56
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:02,199
Once I help you find the phoenix crown
and Buddha Head,

57
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:05,080
I hope you honor our deal.

58
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:08,800
Rest assured.

59
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,360
Mr. Rong,

60
00:04:26,839 --> 00:04:28,480
too much has happened recently,

61
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:32,240
and I'm always anxious
and scared for no reason.

62
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,600
I'm afraid of losing important things

63
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,800
or important people.

64
00:04:40,399 --> 00:04:44,120
The Governor is utterly devoted to you.
You'll never lose him.

65
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,920
This is the keepsake
your mother left you.

66
00:05:16,079 --> 00:05:17,399
Are you sure you want to bury it?

67
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:20,319
Going through my mother's belongings,
I suddenly realized

68
00:05:20,959 --> 00:05:22,560
that her greatest wish in life

69
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:25,360
was to share a bed in life
and a grave in death

70
00:05:26,279 --> 00:05:27,079
with Head Rong.

71
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:31,920
Fortunately, the truth about what
she went through has come to light.

72
00:05:32,279 --> 00:05:36,279
But those past days
can never be brought back.

73
00:05:37,759 --> 00:05:41,319
This phoenix crown carries all the past

74
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:43,959
and her unfulfilled longings.

75
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:49,240
Now, I shall let it stay here
in this forest

76
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,000
with all in the past.

77
00:05:53,399 --> 00:05:56,879
It can rest in peace like my mother.

78
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:05,680
For me, it's also
letting go of obsessions.

79
00:06:06,399 --> 00:06:07,800
Sometimes, letting go of obsessions

80
00:06:08,839 --> 00:06:12,600
is a blessing
for both yourself and others.

81
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:17,120
Mr. Rong, this fleeting life
is like a dream within a dream,

82
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,319
and worldly matters
are like whispers in wind.

83
00:06:19,319 --> 00:06:22,839
So let the wind
take all worldly matters with it.

84
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:23,959
Alright.

85
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,040
In that case,

86
00:06:32,079 --> 00:06:34,160
it's time to return this
to its rightful owner.

87
00:06:48,448 --> 00:06:50,464
(To Miss Jiang)

88
00:06:57,792 --> 00:07:00,768
(To Miss Jiang)

89
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:05,439
I want to talk to my mother
a little more.

90
00:07:55,279 --> 00:07:56,079
Governor,

91
00:07:56,639 --> 00:07:59,639
from files that the Xiaosheng Society
thugs hadn't destroyed yet,

92
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,560
we discovered more of their crimes.

93
00:08:01,959 --> 00:08:04,000
And the case from eight years ago

94
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:08,079
is indeed connected to Xu Fan,
who was police chief back then.

95
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,480
Xu Fan.

96
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:23,920
Ghost!

97
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,560
Stay away!

98
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,399
Stay away!

99
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:27,720
When you killed my mother,

100
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,959
didn't you ever think a vengeful ghost
would come back for you?

101
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:35,720
Vengeful ghost? You've come
to take my life, haven't you?

102
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:36,879
Vengeful ghost,

103
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,177
I didn't kill anyone.
I didn't kill anyone.

104
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:18,000
I hit it.

105
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,360
Like this.

106
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,879
We finally found you.

107
00:09:40,879 --> 00:09:41,379
Get him!

108
00:09:43,399 --> 00:09:43,899
Move!

109
00:09:44,159 --> 00:09:44,759
Let go of me!

110
00:09:44,759 --> 00:09:45,320
Move!

111
00:09:46,039 --> 00:09:46,600
Behave!

112
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:47,120
Let go of me!

113
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:47,860
Move!

114
00:09:48,919 --> 00:09:49,440
Move!

115
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,120
Don't kill me,

116
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:57,360
vengeful ghost.
Please, Lord Vengeful Ghost.

117
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,200
Don't kill me,

118
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:58,919
vengeful ghost.

119
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:02,840
You'an?

120
00:10:09,159 --> 00:10:10,840
Since you don't have a proper name,

121
00:10:12,279 --> 00:10:13,080
from now on,

122
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,639
take my surname.

123
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:24,919
You'an.

124
00:10:28,039 --> 00:10:28,840
You'an,

125
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,360
I'm your father.

126
00:10:31,879 --> 00:10:33,399
You won't kill me, right?

127
00:10:33,399 --> 00:10:34,200
You'an.

128
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:41,000
Before, to repay what you call
your ten years of bringing me up,

129
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:43,559
even though you were utterly evil,

130
00:10:43,559 --> 00:10:45,000
I still let you live on.

131
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,240
But now,

132
00:10:48,639 --> 00:10:50,720
even if you act like a dog,

133
00:10:54,559 --> 00:10:56,120
you're not worthy of that.

134
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,120
I didn't do it.

135
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:01,480
It was the Xiaosheng Society
and Du Xiaolin.

136
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,960
They forced me to do it.

137
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:06,620
Spare me.

138
00:11:06,679 --> 00:11:09,159
(Could they really be colluding
with the Japanese?)

139
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:12,080
(So they have such powerful weapons.)

140
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:14,919
I don't know.

141
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:21,120
Where are the Xiaosheng Society's
weapons?

142
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:25,559
I only know there's a ship.
A very big one.

143
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:28,120
And it seems to be smoking.

144
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:30,799
If you don't tell the truth,
you'll die right now!

145
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:34,279
I really don't know.

146
00:11:54,144 --> 00:11:55,424
♪As if it were fate♪

147
00:11:55,424 --> 00:11:56,781
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

148
00:11:57,343 --> 00:12:00,580
♪We miss each other♪

149
00:12:01,824 --> 00:12:03,392
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

150
00:12:03,392 --> 00:12:05,792
♪And a bizarre♪

151
00:12:05,792 --> 00:12:08,594
♪Anonymous legend♪

152
00:12:09,124 --> 00:12:11,136
♪The plot twists and turns♪

153
00:12:11,284 --> 00:12:13,024
♪Play out over and over again♪

154
00:12:13,024 --> 00:12:16,088
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

155
00:12:16,669 --> 00:12:18,368
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

156
00:12:18,368 --> 00:12:19,360
♪Refuse to submit♪

157
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:22,560
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

158
00:12:24,224 --> 00:12:27,136
♪There are always too many♪

159
00:12:27,136 --> 00:12:29,024
♪Helpless situations♪

160
00:12:29,024 --> 00:12:31,648
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

161
00:12:32,779 --> 00:12:34,739
♪Even if I have questions♪

162
00:12:34,739 --> 00:12:36,739
♪I harbor desires♪

163
00:12:36,739 --> 00:12:39,616
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

164
00:12:39,967 --> 00:12:41,600
♪People come and go♪

165
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:44,416
♪I'm still all alone♪

166
00:12:44,416 --> 00:12:47,144
♪Wandering around♪

167
00:12:47,392 --> 00:12:50,245
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

168
00:12:50,245 --> 00:12:54,706
♪Go through the entanglement♪

169
00:12:55,072 --> 00:12:56,800
♪If longing♪

170
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:59,959
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

171
00:12:59,959 --> 00:13:02,714
♪How can I be at ease♪

172
00:13:02,816 --> 00:13:05,130
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

173
00:13:05,248 --> 00:13:07,104
♪And travelled around the world♪

174
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:10,288
♪Scars all over me♪

175
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:13,472
♪If longing never fades♪

176
00:13:13,472 --> 00:13:14,921
♪Burns still hot♪

177
00:13:14,921 --> 00:13:18,000
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

178
00:13:18,272 --> 00:13:20,129
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

179
00:13:20,192 --> 00:13:21,376
♪In the next life♪

180
00:13:21,376 --> 00:13:25,856
♪Entangle with you again♪
